<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/internationalized-resource-identifier-iri> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A globally unique identifier format used throughout xAPI to identify things such as Verbs, Activities, Activity types, extensions, and other vocabulary concepts. IRIs can contain international characters and include a scheme." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/internationalized-resource-identifier-iri/versions/1> .
