<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/internationalized-resource-identifier-iri> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "IRIs let independent systems refer to the same concepts without relying on local database identifiers, which is fundamental to semantic interoperability." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/internationalized-resource-identifier-iri/versions/1> .
